 ### Approach
 - **Fold (Step 5c).** `design-publish.sh` becomes the single mechanical tail: validate `composed-plan.md` (Tier 2 only via the existing `invoke-plan-validator.sh` -> `design-driver.sh` -> `validate-plan.sh` chain), redact to `composed-plan.redacted.md`, then run the unchanged publish tail. The orchestrator only composes `composed-plan.md` then calls the driver once. The one hand-back is `exit 4` (`VALIDATE_STATUS=defects-found`), which routes to the shared handler.
-- **Unconditional validation.** `review_budget` is always `full` today (both SIMPLE and HARD), so its `quick` branch and `--force-validate` are dead. Remove the field end-to-end and delete the skip branch in `design-postplan-emit.sh` so the validator always runs. `design_classification` (SIMPLE/HARD) is untouched.
-- **Prompt-mediated defect handling.** Keep the existing shared validator-failure prompt. **plan.txt sites** keep `VALIDATE_PLAN_COMMANDS` Fix loops. **Step 5c** uses site-specific Fix/Override: full `design-publish.sh` re-capture (with `--skip-validate` only on Override), never standalone composed-plan validation. Anti-halt / Final summary / Step 5d must not advance on rc 4 until the retry loop settles.
+- **Unconditional validation.** Delete the quick-skip branch in `design-postplan-emit.sh` so the validator always runs; stop emitting/reading `review_budget` in new `run-params.json`. Keep `--force-validate` and `--review-budget` argv accepted as no-ops so resumed scripts and external callers do not fail unknown-option. `design_classification` (SIMPLE/HARD) is untouched.
+- **Prompt-mediated defect handling.** Keep the existing shared validator-failure prompt. **plan.txt sites** keep `VALIDATE_PLAN_COMMANDS` Fix loops. **Step 5c** uses site-specific Fix/Override: full `design-publish.sh` re-capture (with `--skip-validate` only on Override), never standalone composed-plan validation. Step 5c parse must accept rc-4 stdout fallback (mirror rc 3) so defects-found reaches the shared handler when result-env write fails. Anti-halt / Final summary / Step 5d must not advance on rc 4 until the retry loop settles.
 
 ### Edge cases
 - `composed-plan.md` present but empty -> exit 2 (precondition).
